            "post": {
                "operationId": "moonlight_v1",
                "summary": "Dispatch v1 action",
                "description": "Send `POST /api/v1/` with `{ \"service\", \"action\", ...params }`.\n\nChoose a named request example for the action you want to call.\n\n### Auth\n\n- `auth.create_auth` \u2014 Creates an auth record\n- `auth.delete_auth` \u2014 Deletes an auth record\n- `auth.get_auth` \u2014 Returns auth context for the current request\n- `auth.list_auth` \u2014 Lists auth records (demo stub)\n- `auth.update_auth` \u2014 Updates an auth record\n\n### Category\n\n- `category.list` \u2014 List all companies\n- `category.save_or_update` \u2014 Create or update a company row\n- `category.update` \u2014 Update a company by id\n\n### Mail\n\n- `mail.send_welcome` \u2014 Queued welcome email demo\n\n### Sampolo\n\n- `sampolo.create` \u2014 Create a new row\n- `sampolo.delete` \u2014 Delete a row by primary key\n- `sampolo.details` \u2014 Alias for the `retrieve` action\n- `sampolo.edit` \u2014 Alias for the `update` action\n- `sampolo.list` \u2014 List rows with optional pagination\n- `sampolo.random` \u2014 Return random row(s)\n- `sampolo.retrieve` \u2014 Fetch one row by primary key\n- `sampolo.save` \u2014 Alias for the `create` action\n- `sampolo.update` \u2014 Update an existing row\n",
